Q: What was revenue in 2024 Q3, and what caused the Midwest decline?

  span                                         time tok in/out     cost
  clarity.request        ##################  6638ms                  
    model.call           ####                1482ms  414/78  $0.00011
    tool.query_warehouse     ####            1766ms                  
      model.parse            ###             1466ms  742/65  $0.00015
    tool.search_documents        #####       2159ms                  
      model.embed                ##           980ms   16/0           
      model.parse                   ###      1170ms  177/22  $0.00004
    model.call                         ###   1230ms 1072/95  $0.00022

  2,421 tokens in, 260 out, $0.00052 total

                    calls       in    out      cost   share
  model.call            2    1,486    173   0.00033     63%
  model.parse           2      919     87   0.00019     37%
